Tuikio: build without sound. kira plays it through cpal, which needs ALSA (libasound), and Android
has none. src/audio.rs keeps the interface the game calls, with a play() that does nothing, and
kira leaves Cargo.toml (the lock without it is native/ports/unipac/Cargo.lock).

--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -7,6 +7,5 @@
 
 [dependencies]
 crossterm = "0.29.0"
-kira = "0.12.2"
 rand = "0.10.2"
 time = "0.3.54"
--- a/src/audio.rs
+++ b/src/audio.rs
@@ -1,10 +1,5 @@
